On Apr 23, 2:06 pm, MJneth...@gmail.com wrote:
> I have a stack of enchanted daggers.  I'd like to wield one of them
> and put the rest in my quiver.  I've tried various combinations of
> dropping and naming to no avail.  Is there any way to do this?  Thanks.

Name the stack "wield". Drop one. Rename the stack "throw". Pick up
the one dagger you dropped, which will still have its name "wield".

Two stacks won't merge (even if you #adjust one onto the other) if
they have two separate names. If only one (or neither) is named, then
they will merge. So that's why you have to give them different names.

